      "text": "Counterpoint on $MRVL / $LITE acqusition:\n\n- \"Every buyer that competes with Marvell will want a second, independent laser source\".\n\nThey identify $SIVE / Scintil Photonics as new CW / ELS capacity, with names like $CRDO as potential partners of Sivers.\n\n- \"With Lumentum sold out for years, the overflow goes to whoever has merchant capacity\"\n\nAlready said this before, but we'll likely see some incentive to diversify laser sourcing. \n\nSivers was cited here, and comes online with 100M lasers / external foundry capacity (2:1 external/internal target). \n\nTo demonstrate the sheer scale on that, $AA",
