      "text": "Nah markets are trolling now… $ESMT ($2.3B MC) memory earnings + investor conference:\n\n- Revenue: $679.4M\n- Gross profit: $526.2M (77.44% margin)\n- Operating profit: $403.4M (59.37% margin)\n\nAnnualized Q3 would be $1.61B operating profit. \n\nThey’re also sitting on $757M net cash + $278M in inventory…\n\nSo you only need ~3.5x more quarters until they exceed their marketcap in assets.\n\n- Economic Daily also reported that management does not expect a meaningful increase in DDR2/DDR3 supply in 2027 and believes prices can be maintained\n\nSo yes, I think markets are trolling now with selling off a 1.",
