      "text": "All of $AEHR customers saying \"In fact, that’s kind of everybody right now. Ship as quickly as you can.\" doesn't quite sound like any potential order cancellations lol.\n\nGenuine earnings beat, lot of orders faster than revenue recognition, and overall demand acceleration. \n\nThen there's upside: \n-\"We believe this customer represents one of the largest potential burn-in system opportunities Aehr has ever pursued\"\n\nFrom a \"major supplier of AI accelerators, CPUs, and network processors\", which sounds more like $AMD given historical context. \n\n- $AEHR saw acceleration from multiple silicon-photon",
