      "text": "People on X (now YC companies included) learned that it’s easier to doompost for impressions.\n\n$SPCX + Elon wouldn’t be heavily building in the Neocloud space if they didn’t see the ROI.\n\nSamsung wouldn’t be selling 5-10Y LTAs to Chinese big tech, if Alibaba/Tencent/Bytedance saw memory overflooding in 2 years.\n\n$LITE wouldn’t be sold out into 2029 and announce new $5B UHP laser contracts if optical demand didn’t persist.\n\nIt’s interesting seeing the very same people long $SNDK, $NBIS, to $COHR 2 months ago. Flip flop on every market narrative from the initial Iran War to the current “AI Bubbl",
